 =?UTF-8?q?=20Artist's=20sampling?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 10.10.2026: «Обязательно в Артисте добавишь селекторы для семплеров и планировщиков, выбор количества шагов с разумным ограничением и т.п.».

«Sampling» under the painter, folded, its summary the values in use: the steps (Krea 2 and 2512 with Lightning 4 to 16, else 10 to 60), the sampler (Euler, Euler SDE), the schedule (Simple, Karras, Exponential, Beta); for 2512 Lightning's strength (0 turns it off) and, without it, the guidance. Kept per painter in this browser, Reset gives the painter's own, Draw carries what differs; the time follows the steps; a run's stage says them, To the form and Again take them.

Suite: 577/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css          | 11 +++++++
 tools/console/heresy-artist.js | 58 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++--
 tools/console/index.html       | 11 +++++++
 3 files changed, 78 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index 1a20b9d..11e444a 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -4587,6 +4587,17 @@ body[data-frame] :is(#view-compose, #view-take) { scrollbar-gutter: stable; }
 .tr-voice-opts { display: inline-flex; gap: 4px; }
 .tr-voice .tr-chip { padding: 2px 9px; }
 .tr-voice .tr-chip.is-on { border-color: var(--amber); color: var(--amber); }
+/* HERESY 1319: the sampling, folded, its values in the summary */
+.ar-sampling { flex: 1 1 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line-a); border-radius: var(--r-sm); padding: 4px 8px; }
+.ar-sampling > summary { cursor: pointer; display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; padding: 2px 0; list-style: none; }
+.ar-sampling > summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
+.ar-sampling > summary::before { content: "▸"; color: var(--dim); font-size: 11px; }
+.ar-sampling[open] > summary::before { content: "▾"; }
+.ar-sampling > summary em { font-style: normal; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); white-space: nowrap; overflow: hidden; text-overflow: ellipsis; min-width: 0; }
+.ar-samp-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 10px; align-items: flex-end; padding: 6px 0 4px; }
+.ar-samp-row .field { margin: 0; }
+.ar-samp-row select { min-width: 7.5em; }
+.ar-samp-steps input, .ar-samp-num input { width: 5.5em; }
 /* HERESY 1318: the fp8 fine-tune's choice and the painter's note */
 .ar-model { width: 17.5em; flex: none; }
 .ar-pnote { flex: 1 1 100%; margin: -4px 0 0; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.45; color: var(--muted); }
diff --git a/tools/console/heresy-artist.js b/tools/console/heresy-artist.js
index 5cf65c8..ac11ae5 100644
